<title>LUXEMBOURG: EU did not discuss stability pact - Italy's Ciampi.</title>
<headline>EU did not discuss stability pact - Italy's Ciampi.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union finance ministers did not discuss the EU's stability pact at a dinner meeting on Sunday evening, Italian Finance Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi told reporters at the end of the meeting.</p>
<p>&quot;It wasn't part of the agenda tonight,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
